  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large paella pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the garlic and saut\u0014 until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the tomato paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the Mediterranean rice and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the chicken broth, water, and saffron threads, and bring to a boil.",
    "Add the fish and cook for 2-3 minutes, or until it starts to flake apart.",
    "Add the unsalted butter and stir until melted.",
    "Stir in the salt and cook for 1-2 minutes, or until the rice is cooked and the fish is cooked through.",
    "Let the paella rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
